      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. i'll try to do smaller doses. one more thing though—is there any chance there's something else in the soil messing with the nutrients? like maybe something living in the ground that's preventing the roots from actually taking up the phosphorus or nitrogen? i'm worried about pests or something under the surface.",
